      "chat_id": "c_001",
      "sender_id": "u_lina",
      "text": "We're planning to run the new S3->warehouse ingest nightly at 02:00 UTC. Is everyone okay with that?",
      "ts": 1,
      "reply_to": null,
      "reactions": {
        ":+1:": [
          "u_mae"
        ]
      },
      "read_by": [
        "u_lina"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m_002",
      "chat_id": "c_001",
      "sender_id": "u_mae",
      "text": "02:00 is fine in principle, but we should offset from other heavy jobs. Can we move to 03:30 to avoid overlap with the backup window?",
      "ts": 2,
      "reply_to": "m_001",
      "reactions": {},
      "read_by": [
        "u_mae"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m_003",
      "chat_id": "c_001",
      "sender_id": "u_owen",
      "text": "Also flagging that the retention policy convo from last sprint might bump the on-disk usage — we should include that in the estimate.",
      "ts": 3,
      "reply_to": null,
      "reactions": {},
      "read_by": [
        "u_owen",
        "u_me"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m_004",
      "chat_id": "c_001",
      "sender_id": "u_owen",
      "text": "I prefer 02:00 to keep it earlier; 03:30 will push downstream jobs later and might break SLAs.",
